DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31377::$$$message_0240_0000_0000$$$::I cross the bridge into Shinto.[lr]::
31378::$$$message_0240_0000_0001$$$::The walkway on the bridge is completely empty at this hour.[lr]::
31379::$$$message_0240_0000_0002$$$::There aren't any cars on the street tonight. I can clearly hear the wind blowing in from the sea.::
31380::$$$message_0240_0001_0000$$$::"It's like a total redo of everything from half a year ago.[lr]::
31381::$$$message_0240_0001_0001$$$::Back then, we..."[lr]::
31382::$$$message_0240_0001_0002$$$::Saber, Tohsaka, and I headed into Shinto together like this, too.[lr]::
31383::$$$message_0240_0001_0003$$$::We didn't say anything to each other. I was anxious about where I was being taken, but I was also eager to embark on an adventure.::
31384::$$$message_0240_0002_0000$$$::But what about now?[lr]::
31385::$$$message_0240_0002_0001$$$::Anyone can see that something strange is happening to Fuyuki.[lr]::
31386::$$$message_0240_0002_0002$$$::As for what's strange, specifically...[move textoff=0 opacity=0 base=027_アチャ光点 cx=55 layer=0 py=180 px=280 affine=(280,180,+0.0,0.6,155,55,55)(280,180,-45,0.8,255,55,55)(280,180,-90,0.6,155,55,55)(280,180,-135,0.4,0,55,55) time=1500 cy=55 mag=0.4 deg=45 accel=0]maybe it's wrong of me,[lr]::
31387::$$$message_0240_0002_0003$$$::but I'm getting comfortable with this reenacted Holy Grail War.::
31388::$$$message_0240_0003_0000$$$::"...Hey, it's a good thing if nobody's picking fights for no good reason."[lr]::
31389::$$$message_0240_0003_0001$$$::There's no reason to fight.[lr]::
31390::$$$message_0240_0003_0002$$$::So my life isn't in danger.[lr]::
31391::$$$message_0240_0003_0003$$$::While there might not be anyone to hate or any mastermind behind it all[line len=2]::
31392::$$$message_0240_0004_0000$$$::"...Nngh!?"[lr]::
31393::$$$message_0240_0004_0001$$$::It happened in an instant.[lr]::
31394::$$$message_0240_0004_0002$$$::[movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=1200 accel=0 storage=こぼれる血b]No, I probably never understood what happened.::
31395::$$$message_0240_0005_0000$$$::"Burgh...!"[lr]::
31396::$$$message_0240_0005_0001$$$::I lurch forward, bracing myself against a handrail.[lr]::
31397::$$$message_0240_0005_0002$$$::Blood spills out, taking my life with it.[lr]::
31398::$$$message_0240_0005_0003$$$::It's too late. This is a mortal wound that nearly killed me instantly.::
31399::$$$message_0240_0006_0000$$$::"Hah...argh..."[lr]::
31400::$$$message_0240_0006_0001$$$::Subconsciously, my dying eyes catch sight of him.[lr]::
31401::$$$message_0240_0006_0002$$$::I was an idiot to think that I didn't need to fear death just because [font italic=true]I[font italic=false] don't have any reason to fight.[lr]::
31402::$$$message_0240_0006_0003$$$::Scornful eyes watch me collapse to the ground.::
31403::$$$message_0240_0007_0000$$$::"Ass...hole..."[lr]::
31404::$$$message_0240_0007_0001$$$::My killer shot me with an arrow, without so much as a remark.[lr]::
31405::$$$message_0240_0007_0002$$$::It killed me before I had any chance to react. Then, he looses a second arrow...::
931392::$$$message_9240_0004_0000$$$::"...Nngh!?"[r]::

